WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.480
HWÆT, WE GAR-DEna in geardagum,&nbsp;
þeodcyninga þrym gefrunon,&nbsp;

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:14.549
hu ða æþelingas ellen fremedon!&nbsp;
oft Scyld Scefing sceaþena þreatum,&nbsp;

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:21.199
monegum mægþum meodosetla ofteah,&nbsp;
egsode eorlas, syððanærest wearð

00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:29.160
feasceaft funden; he þæs frofre gebad,
weox under wolcnum weorðmyndum þah,

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:37.370
oð þæt him æghwylc ymbsittendra
ofer hronrade hyran scolde,&nbsp;

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:45.469
gomban gyldan; þæt wæs god cyning!&nbsp;
Ðæm eafera wæs æfter cenned&nbsp;

00:00:45.469 --> 00:00:51.370
geong in geardum, þone God sende&nbsp;
folce to frofre; fyrenðearfe ongeat,&nbsp;

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:59.690
þe hie ær drugon aldorlease&nbsp;
lange hwile; him þæs Liffrea,&nbsp;

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:04.860
wuldres Wealdend woroldare forgeaf,&nbsp;
Beowulf wæs breme --- blæd wide sprang---&nbsp;

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:14.860
Scyldes eafera Scedelandum in.&nbsp;
Swa sceal geong guma gode gewyrcean,&nbsp;

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:17.350
fromum feohgiftumon fæder bearme,

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:24.010
þæt hine on ylde eft gewunigen&nbsp;
wilgesiþas, þonne wig cume,&nbsp;

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:35.770
leode gelæsten; lofdædum sceal
in mægþa gehwære man geþeon.&nbsp;

